#: src/components/forms/ProductForm/index.tsx:320
msgid "<0>Please enter the price excluding taxes and fees.</0><1>Taxes and fees can be added below.</1>"
msgstr "<0>Inserisci il prezzo escluse tasse e commissioni.</0><1>Tasse e commissioni possono essere aggiunte qui sotto.</1>"

#: src/components/common/CapacityAssignmentList/index.tsx:47
msgid "<0>Set a single total attendance limit that applies to multiple ticket types at once.</0><1>For example, if you link a <2>Day Pass</2> and a <3>Full Weekend</3> ticket, they will both draw from the same pool of spots. Once the limit is reached, all linked tickets automatically stop selling.</1>"
msgstr "<0>Imposta un unico limite di presenze totale che si applichi a più tipi di biglietto contemporaneamente.</0><1>Ad esempio, se colleghi un <2>Pass Giornaliero</2> e un biglietto <3>Weekend Completo</3>, entrambi verranno estratti dallo stesso gruppo di posti. Una volta raggiunto il limite, la vendita di tutti i biglietti collegati verrà interrotta automaticamente.</1>"

#: src/components/forms/ProductForm/index.tsx:337
msgid "<0>The total number of individual tickets that can ever be sold for this product. Sold tickets are subtracted from this total automatically — you don't need to adjust for them.</0><1>To re-open a sold-out product, raise this value above the number already sold.</1><2>If the product requires a minimum quantity per order (e.g. a table of 10), set this to the total individual tickets (e.g. 20 for 2 tables of 10).</2><3>This value can be further constrained by <4>Capacity Limits</4> associated with this product.</3>"
msgstr ""

#: src/components/common/OrganizerWebhookTable/index.tsx:205
#: src/components/common/WebhookTable/index.tsx:205
msgid "<0>Webhooks instantly notify external services when events happen, like adding a new attendee to your CRM or mailing list upon registration, ensuring seamless automation.</0><1>Use third-party services like <2>Zapier</2>, <3>IFTTT</3> or <4>Make</4> to create custom workflows and automate tasks.</1>"
msgstr "<0>I webhook notificano istantaneamente i servizi esterni quando si verificano eventi, come l'aggiunta di un nuovo partecipante al tuo CRM o alla mailing list al momento della registrazione, garantendo un'automazione senza interruzioni.</0><1>Utilizza servizi di terze parti come <2>Zapier</2>, <3>IFTTT</3> o <4>Make</4> per creare flussi di lavoro personalizzati e automatizzare le attività.</1>"

